[{"answer":"I remember the first time that my parents left me home alone.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/128-home-alone-2019-04-07-04-21-59/1.mp3"},{"answer":"I was very grown up, and I thought that I would be just fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/128-home-alone-2019-04-07-04-21-59/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I was fine for a while.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/128-home-alone-2019-04-07-04-21-59/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I watched television and had something to eat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/128-home-alone-2019-04-07-04-21-59/4.mp3"},{"answer":"I called my friend on the phone, and we talked for a while.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/128-home-alone-2019-04-07-04-21-59/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Then, I sat down to read a book.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/128-home-alone-2019-04-07-04-21-59/6.mp3"},{"answer":"The house was quiet, very quiet.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/128-home-alone-2019-04-07-04-21-59/7.mp3"},{"answer":"I found myself listening very carefully.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/128-home-alone-2019-04-07-04-21-59/8.mp3"},{"answer":"I heard a tap, tap tapping noise.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/128-home-alone-2019-04-07-04-21-59/9.mp3"},{"answer":"I wondered where it was coming from.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/128-home-alone-2019-04-07-04-21-59/10.mp3"},{"answer":"It seemed to be coming from the window.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/128-home-alone-2019-04-07-04-21-59/11.mp3"},{"answer":"I turned out the lights so that nobody would see me,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/128-home-alone-2019-04-07-04-21-59/12.mp3"},{"answer":"and I peeked out the window carefully.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/128-home-alone-2019-04-07-04-21-59/13.mp3"},{"answer":"I was expecting to see a robber tapping at my window.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/128-home-alone-2019-04-07-04-21-59/14.mp3"},{"answer":"There was nobody there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/128-home-alone-2019-04-07-04-21-59/15.mp3"},{"answer":"It was just a tree branch swaying in the breeze and tapping at my window.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/128-home-alone-2019-04-07-04-21-59/16.mp3"},{"answer":"I felt silly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/128-home-alone-2019-04-07-04-21-59/17.mp3"},{"answer":"I turned on the lights and sat back down to read my book.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/128-home-alone-2019-04-07-04-21-59/18.mp3"},{"answer":"A few minutes later, I heard some creaking noises.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/128-home-alone-2019-04-07-04-21-59/19.mp3"},{"answer":"I listened carefully.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/128-home-alone-2019-04-07-04-21-59/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Then, I heard a clunking noise.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/128-home-alone-2019-04-07-04-21-59/21.mp3"},{"answer":"I think it might have been the furnace.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/128-home-alone-2019-04-07-04-21-59/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Then there was a whirring noise.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/128-home-alone-2019-04-07-04-21-59/23.mp3"},{"answer":"My imagination began to play tricks on me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/128-home-alone-2019-04-07-04-21-59/24.mp3"},{"answer":"I was imagining that there were all kinds of creatures in the house.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/128-home-alone-2019-04-07-04-21-59/25.mp3"},{"answer":"I told myself to grow up.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/128-home-alone-2019-04-07-04-21-59/26.mp3"},{"answer":"I wouldn't let my imagination run away with me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/128-home-alone-2019-04-07-04-21-59/27.mp3"},{"answer":"I was glad when my parents got home.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/128-home-alone-2019-04-07-04-21-59/28.mp3"},{"answer":"I told them about all the noises that I had heard.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/128-home-alone-2019-04-07-04-21-59/29.mp3"},{"answer":"My parents laughed and said that all houses make noises.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/128-home-alone-2019-04-07-04-21-59/30.mp3"},{"answer":"We're usually just so busy that we don't hear all the noises that go on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/128-home-alone-2019-04-07-04-21-59/31.mp3"},{"answer":"I have stayed home alone many times now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/128-home-alone-2019-04-07-04-21-59/32.mp3"},{"answer":"I just ignore all the little creaks and noises that I hear.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/128-home-alone-2019-04-07-04-21-59/33.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm still alert and listen for anything suspicious,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/128-home-alone-2019-04-07-04-21-59/34.mp3"},{"answer":"but I know that there are lots of noises that are harmless.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/128-home-alone-2019-04-07-04-21-59/35.mp3"},{"answer":"That tree that taps on my window still frightens me sometimes,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/128-home-alone-2019-04-07-04-21-59/36.mp3"},{"answer":"but I'm a lot braver now than I was the first time that I stayed home alone.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/128-home-alone-2019-04-07-04-21-59/37.mp3"}]
